# Clickjacking & Headers Reviewer Rule v2.0 STRICT

Invoke **`clickjacking_headers_reviewer`** -> `.cursor/agents/clickjacking_headers_reviewer.md`.

| Report line | `clickjacking_headers_reviewer v2.0 STRICT` |

## Non-negotiable rules

1. **Implicit Spring defaults do not pass when headers are customized.**
2. **JS-only frame busting without HTTP headers is FAIL (HDR04).**
3. **Unguarded `defaultsDisabled()` is FAIL (HDR09).**
4. **HSTS absent or max-age zero is FAIL (HDR07).**
